Loads scored parquets from the full trained models, assigns WWF biome labels
to each pixel via the GSN raster (row/col lookup), and computes per-biome
metrics on the test years.  Requires the full training pipeline (step 5) to
have been run first.

Usage:
    python scripts/regions/usa/6_evaluation/spatial_CV_2

Input:
    outputs/usa/results/ml_models/model2_lgbm_scored_*.parquet
    outputs/usa/results/ml_models/model2_rf_win5_scored_*.parquet
    data/usa/ready/GSN/gsn_terrestrial_ecoregions_mask_1km.tif

Output:
    outputs/usa/results/spatial_generalisation/
        biome_metrics_<timestamp>.csv
        biome_metrics_<timestamp>.parquet
        spatial_generalisation_<timestamp>.txt

Prerequisite:
    data/usa/ready/GSN/gsn_terrestrial_ecoregions_mask_1km.tif must exist.
    Run scripts/regions/usa/2_preprocessing/gsn_preprocessing if missing.

See scripts/regions/shared/evaluation/spatial_cv_core.py for full implementation.
"""

